[gd_resource type="SpriteFrames" load_steps=2 format=3]

; TEST ART. One hand-drawn frame (idle, 3/4 facing screen-right) standing in
; for the swarm's entire animation set, so the creature stays on screen while
; scale, pivot and lighting are judged against the real camera. Every entry
; here except idle_se is a placeholder to be replaced by real art.
;
; Directions: only the 5 authored ones. nw/w/sw come from unit_visual.gd's
; MIRROR table, which is safe for the swarm because it carries no weapon.

